  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\: \\Omega\"></span> resistor is connected to a cell of emf <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\"></span> V and a switch as shown on the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>When the switch is open, the voltmeter reading is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\"></span> V and when the switch is closed, the voltmeter reading is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> V. What is the internal resistance of the cell?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\\: \\Omega\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\: \\Omega\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\\: \\Omega\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9.0\\: \\Omega\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
